Package: jarvis-branding
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-label, grub-common
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ look: logo, boot splash, boot menu, wallpaper
 Ring logo and icons, the Plymouth theme "jarvis" with the disk unlock
 prompt, the GRUB theme and menu defaults, the wallpaper, and the
 @PRETTY_NAME@ /etc/os-release.
